  "title": "27 February 1965: Filming: Help!, the Bahamas",
  "date": "1965-02-27",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>On the fifth day of filming <em>Help!</em> in the Bahamas, The Beatles appeared in scenes on Balmoral Island, including the famous sequence for <a href=\"/songs/another-girl/\">‘Another Girl’</a>. <span id=\"more-4421\"></span></p><p>Balmoral Island was renamed Discovery Island in 1992.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1965-photos/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-27923\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"27923\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1965-photos/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1581,952\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles film the Another Girl sequence in Help! on Balmoral Island, Bahamas, 27 February 1965\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01-960x578.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01-960x578.jpg\" alt=\"The Beatles film the Another Girl sequence in Help! on Balmoral Island, Bahamas, 27 February 1965\" width=\"800\" height=\"482\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-27923\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01-960x578.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01-580x349.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01-200x120.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01-768x462.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01-1536x925.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/650227-beatles-help-another-girl_01.jpg 1581w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 16 November 2022</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2015: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2015/02/27/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-vivo-rio-rio-de-janeiro/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Vivo Rio, Rio de Janeiro</a></li><li>2013: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2013/02/27/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-zepp-nagoya/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Zepp, Nagoya</a></li><li>1979: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1979/02/27/mixing-after-the-ball-million-miles-wings/\">Mixing: After The Ball, Million Miles by Wings</a></li><li>1976: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1976/02/27/mixing-beware-my-love-wino-junko-silly-love-songs-wings/\">Mixing: Beware My Love, Wino Junko, Silly Love Songs by Wings</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/02/27/recording-love-in-song-wings-2/\">Recording: Love In Song by Wings</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/02/27/recording-and-i-love-her-tell-me-why-if-i-fell/\">Recording: And I Love Her, Tell Me Why, If I Fell</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/02/27/live-rialto-theatre-york/\">The Beatles live: Rialto Theatre, York</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/02/27/live-cavern-club-liverpool-143/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=f6481605149f666824b63cda92864921&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=4421&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
